6.3 Referential Integrity
Every evidence.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every intervention.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every misconception_relation.misconception_id and misconception_relation.related_misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every stag_link.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every work_link.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every provenance.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

Every moderation.misconception_id must exist in misconception.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The misconception relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

